{"name":"Cold Spring","hex":"#88bb66","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Cold Spring","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A place in the United States:\nA home rule city in Campbell County, Kentucky.\nA city in Stearns County, Minnesota.\nAn unincorporated community in Cape May County, New Jersey.\nA village in the town of Philipstown, Putnam County, New York. \nAn unincorporated community in Bledsoe County, Tennessee.\nA town and unincorporated community in Jefferson County, Wisconsin.","A home rule city in Campbell County, Kentucky."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Cold_Spring"}],"entries":[{"title":"Northeastern Manitoulin and the Islands","blocks":[{"text":"Northeastern Manitoulin and the Islands is a municipality with town status in Manitoulin District in Northeastern Ontario, Canada, approximately 30 kilometres (19 mi) south of Espanola. Its main town is Little Current, located on the northeast side of Manitoulin Island. However, its territory also includes most of the small islands surrounding Manitoulin, even those at the far western end of Manitoulin."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/52/NE_Manitoulin_ON.JPG/330px-NE_Manitoulin_ON.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Northeastern_Manitoulin_and_the_Islands"},{"title":"Hamilton Township, Ontario","blocks":[{"text":"Hamilton Township is a lower-tier municipality located in Northumberland County in central Ontario. It surrounds the Town of Cobourg, located between Rice Lake and Lake Ontario. Neighbouring municipalities include the Town of Port Hope and Township of Alnwick-Haldimand. The township encompasses a mostly rural landscape of agricultural land, forests, wetlands, and waterfront communities, including the Oak Ridges Moraine."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e1/Township_of_Hamilton_Municipal_Office.jpg/330px-Township_of_Hamilton_Municipal_Office.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hamilton_Township%2C_Ontario"},{"title":"Cold","blocks":[{"text":"Cold is the presence of low temperature, especially in the atmosphere. In common usage, cold is often a subjective perception. A lower bound to temperature is absolute zero, defined as 0.00 K on the Kelvin scale, an absolute thermodynamic temperature scale. This corresponds to −273.15 °C on the Celsius scale, −459.67 °F on the Fahrenheit scale, and 0.00 °R on the Rankine scale."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d5/Antarctic_iceberg%2C_2001_-2.jpg/330px-Antarctic_iceberg%2C_2001_-2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cold"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7f/Little_Current_ON.JPG/500px-Little_Current_ON.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7f/Little_Current_ON.JPG/1280px-Little_Current_ON.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7f/Little_Current_ON.JPG/500px-Little_Current_ON.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Little Current as seen across the North Channel","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ALittle_Current_ON.JPG"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/41/Little_Current_Manitoulin.JPG/500px-Little_Current_Manitoulin.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/41/Little_Current_Manitoulin.JPG/1280px-Little_Current_Manitoulin.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/t